{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":595071,\"title\":\"May 15th\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A French man's monotonous routine is broken when he begins to suspect that he is living the same day again and again.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vKLicvQfyvkIP4rNLUBrygn20Xr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wIUAY4oLu8LoVNAEM5A86C6weeP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":9,\"year\":1969,\"runtime\":30,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"FR\",\"name\":\"France\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Claire Denis\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":9888,\"name\":\"Claire Denis\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zKR7pmegNQDjWqeWv7JNvHqJ2l5.jpg\"},{\"id\":1430906,\"name\":\"Philippe Rouleau\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6R2M60AmTkwvu3YLeuaEgN1f4qr.jpg\"},{\"id\":2196,\"name\":\"Claudia Morin\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3680956,\"name\":\"Madeleine Vim\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3680957,\"name\":\"Mireille Cordelier\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3680958,\"name\":\"Daniel Langlet\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":24766,\"name\":\"Bernard Rousselet\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3680959,\"name\":\"Periana\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3680960,\"name\":\"Antilla\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3680961,\"name\":\"Tony\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":157336,\"title\":\"Interstellar\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yQvGrMoipbRoddT0ZR8tPoR7NfX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8sNiAPPYU14PUepFNeSNGUTiHW.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The adventures of a group of explorers who make use of a newly discovered wormhole to surpass the limitations on human space travel and conquer the vast distances involved in an interstellar voyage.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":335984,\"title\":\"Blade Runner 2049\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gajva2L0rPYkEWjzgFlBXCAVBE5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gNdLJU9TxrpGx4dkZidjys3fyy0.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Thirty years after the events of the first film, a new blade runner, LAPD Officer K, unearths a long-buried secret that has the potential to plunge what's left of society into chaos. K's discovery leads him on a quest to find Rick Deckard, a former LAPD blade runner who has been missing for 30 years.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":329865,\"title\":\"Arrival\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pEzNVQfdzYDzVK0XqxERIw2x2se.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8MUZz7oPXQftFTslZpRP3CVMOoq.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Taking place after alien crafts land around the world, an expert linguist is recruited by the military to determine whether they come in peace or are a threat.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":124905,\"title\":\"Godzilla\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tphkjmQq8WebuVwNXelmjLUXuPJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6CLNOzMXO9bvapDD8gsdwkJU4wN.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ford Brody, a Navy bomb expert, has just reunited with his family in San Francisco when he is forced to go to Japan to help his estranged father, Joe. Soon, both men are swept up in an escalating crisis when an ancient alpha predator arises from the sea to combat malevolent adversaries that threaten the survival of humanity. The creatures leave colossal destruction in their wake, as they make their way toward their final battleground: San Francisco.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1124,\"title\":\"The Prestige\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Ag2B2KHKQPukjH7WutmgnnSNurZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yaExZh6qE2cfyK3o4kAMEq0mkgy.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A mysterious story of two magicians whose intense rivalry leads them on a life-long battle for supremacy -- full of obsession, deceit and jealousy with dangerous and deadly consequences.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":286217,\"title\":\"The Martian\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5BHuvQ6p9kfc091Z8RiFNhCwL4b.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lzMS0CI3FLQYC5EgJoWeIaEt0lm.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a manned mission to Mars, Astronaut Mark Watney is presumed dead after a fierce storm and left behind by his crew. But Watney has survived and finds himself stranded and alone on the hostile planet. With only meager supplies, he must draw upon his ingenuity, wit and spirit to subsist and find a way to signal to Earth that he is alive.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":38,\"title\":\"Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5MwkWH9tYHv3mV9OdYTMR5qreIz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/95qi5TJMIBI5VzWHia88Pbrye7Z.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Joel Barish, heartbroken that his girlfriend underwent a procedure to erase him from her memory, decides to do the same. However, as he watches his memories of her fade away, he realises that he still loves her, and may be too late to correct his mistake.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":263115,\"title\":\"Logan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fnbjcRDYn6YviCcePDnGdyAkYsB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4DZxWNSAyksN6N3JkvpJ53Yq6zU.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the near future, a weary Logan cares for an ailing Professor X in a hideout on the Mexican border. But Logan's attempts to hide from the world and his legacy are upended when a young mutant arrives, pursued by dark forces.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":39254,\"title\":\"Real Steel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4GIeI5K5YdDUkR3mNQBoScpSFEf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pjlxrd646cBYznHoPBWTzz6FujX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Charlie Kenton is a washed-up fighter who retired from the ring when robots took over the sport. After his robot is trashed, he reluctantly teams up with his estranged son to rebuild and train an unlikely contender.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":110415,\"title\":\"Snowpiercer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kw6YQudA0TMcNmGUGy5XIw7zbnV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/55vkNtb83bSwbdWrQTVZTGLBcLx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a future where a failed global-warming experiment kills off most life on the planet, a class system evolves aboard the Snowpiercer; a train that travels around the globe via a perpetual-motion engine.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6479,\"title\":\"I Am Legend\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fhbiz5BsGUVEZmzPP72SoPlbMz0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ePgD1cwmklyrFBjl6z96IuixuSY.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Robert Neville is a scientist who was unable to stop the spread of the terrible virus that was incurable and man-made. Immune, Neville is now the last human survivor in what is left of New York City and perhaps the world. For three years, Neville has faithfully sent out daily radio messages, desperate to find any other survivors who might be out there. But he is not alone.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":152601,\"title\":\"Her\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eCOtqtfvn7mxGl6nfmq4b1exJRc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1YnZchmaGc8dchgRPDpR1KGrixA.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the not so distant future, Theodore, a lonely writer, purchases a newly developed operating system designed to meet the user's every need. To Theodore's surprise, a romantic relationship develops between him and his operating system. This unconventional love story blends science fiction and romance in a sweet tale that explores the nature of love and the ways that technology isolates and connects us all.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"4d86cHhp65Y\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"qb-dUGyv4W0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"cJ8Db-VHnpk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}